        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Core:** `basket_v1` | **Algorithm:** `Apriori Frequent Itemset Mining & Association Rule Mining`\n**Scope:** Transactional point-of-sale receipt basket co-occurrence.\n> \u26a0\ufe0f **Descriptive Co-occurrence Caveat:** Association rules establish empirical co-occurrence patterns in transactional logs; they do not establish causal purchasing mechanisms.\n**Rule Statistics:** Total Canonical Mined Rules = **1,262 rules** | Displayed = **Governed top rules**."
